@startuml
[*] --> Search Initiated
Search Initiated --> Analyzing Query : User query submitted
Analyzing Query --> Searching Shelves : Identifying related books
Searching Shelves --> Suggesting Books : Finding books on shelves
Suggesting Books --> Reviewing Suggestions : Presenting suggestions to user
Reviewing Suggestions --> [*] : User selects a book
Reviewing Suggestions --> Analyzing Query : User refines search
@enduml
